# 🧠 Pump.fun 402 Agent (Solana Native)

[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)](LICENSE)
[![Solana Compatible](https://img.shields.io/badge/Solana-Mainnet-orange.svg)](https://solana.com)
[![Made for AI Agents](https://img.shields.io/badge/AI%20Agent-Ready-blue.svg)](#)
[![Payments-402](https://img.shields.io/badge/HTTP-402%20Payment%20Required-ff69b4.svg)](#)

> **A payment-gated API that lets AI agents deploy tokens on Pump.fun using Solana-native payments (SOL or USDC) and the HTTP `402 Payment Required` standard.**

---

## 🚀 Overview

This service enables **AI agents**, bots, or other automated systems to deploy tokens on **[Pump.fun](https://pump.fun)** after completing a blockchain payment.

It implements the **HTTP 402 protocol** for on-chain payments, verifying Solana transactions in real time and triggering deployments once the payment clears.

---

## ⚙️ Features

- 🔐 **402 Payment Flow** — Native on-chain paywall
- 💸 **SOL / USDC support** — SPL tokens supported
- ⚡ **Real-time Solana TX monitoring**
- 🤖 **Agent-optimized REST & WS API**
- 🪙 **Pump.fun token deployment**
- 🧾 **Optional escrow + refunds**
- 📊 **Prometheus metrics & logging**
- 🪄 **Webhook + WebSocket event hooks**

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```text
┌─────────────┐    402 Request      ┌──────────────┐
│  AI Agent   │ ──────────────────> │  402 Agent   │
│   Wallet    │                     │   Service    │
│             │ <────────────────── │              │
└──────┬──────┘  Payment Address    └──────┬───────┘
       │                                    │
       │  Send SOL/USDC                     │ Monitor
       │                                    │ Payment
       v                                    v
┌─────────────┐                      ┌──────────────┐
│   Solana    │ ──────────────────> │   Pump.fun   │
│ Blockchain  │   Deploy Token       │     API      │
└─────────────┘                      └──────────────┘
```

---

## 🧩 Installation

### Requirements

- Node.js `v18+`
- Solana wallet with SOL for gas
- RPC endpoint (Helius, QuickNode, or public)
- PostgreSQL or MongoDB
- Pump.fun API key

### Setup

```bash
# Clone
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/pumpfun-402-solana-agent.git
cd pumpfun-402-solana-agent

# Install
npm install

# Configure
cp .env.example .env
nano .env
```

### Environment Variables

```env
SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
SOLANA_RPC_WS_URL=wss://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com
PAYMENT_WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY=your_base58_private_key
DEPLOYMENT_WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY=your_deployment_private_key
PUMPFUN_API_URL=https://pumpportal.fun/api
PUMPFUN_PRIVATE_KEY=your_pumpfun_private_key

PRICE_PER_DEPLOYMENT_SOL=0.01
PRICE_PER_DEPLOYMENT_USDC=1.5
USDC_MINT_ADDRESS=EPjFWdd5AufqSSqeM2qN1xzybapC8G4wEGGkZwyTDt1v

PORT=3402
NODE_ENV=production
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/pumpfun402

JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret
WEBHOOK_SECRET=your_webhook_secret
MAX_REQUESTS_PER_HOUR=100
```

---

## 🔌 API Endpoints

### `POST /api/v1/deploy/token`

Initiates token deployment.  
If unpaid, returns **HTTP 402** with a payment address.

**Example Request**
```json
{
  "tokenName": "MyToken",
  "tokenSymbol": "MTK",
  "description": "Deployed by AI",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/token.png",
  "paymentToken": "SOL"
}
```

**Example Response (402)**
```json
{
  "status": 402,
  "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz",
  "payment": {
    "address": "7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU",
    "amount": 0.01,
    "token": "SOL"
  },
  "verifyUrl": "/api/v1/deploy/verify/dep_abc123xyz"
}
```

---

### `GET /api/v1/deploy/verify/{deploymentId}`

Verifies payment and triggers deployment if confirmed.

**Response (paid)**
```json
{
  "status": "executing",
  "deploymentId": "dep_abc123xyz",
  "paid": true
}
```

**Response (unpaid)**
```json
{
  "status": "pending_payment",
  "paid": false
}
```

---

### `GET /api/v1/deploy/status/{deploymentId}`

Returns deployment progress.

**Example**
```json
{
  "status": "completed",
  "tokenAddress": "7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU",
  "pumpfunUrl": "https://pump.fun/7xKXtg2CW87d97TXJSDpbD5jBkheTqA83TZRuJosgAsU"
}
```

---

## 🛰️ WebSocket Events

Connect to  
`wss://api.yourservice.com/ws/payment/{deploymentId}`

**Events**
```json
{ "type": "payment_detected" }
{ "type": "payment_confirmed" }
{ "type": "deployment_started" }
{ "type": "deployment_completed" }
```

---

## 📩 Webhook Notifications

| Event | Description |
|--------|--------------|
| `payment_confirmed` | Payment verified |
| `deployment_started` | Token deployment in progress |
| `deployment_completed` | Deployment finalized |

---

## 💰 Escrow & Refunds

When enabled, payments are held in escrow and released only after:

- Verified on-chain deployment, **and**
- Pump.fun token address confirmation.

Refunds auto-initiate if deployment fails.

---

## 📊 Monitoring

Metrics available at `/metrics` (Prometheus format):

```
deployments_total{status="completed"} 245
payments_confirmed_total 244
deployment_failures_total 1
payment_latency_seconds_avg 12.5
```

---

## 🧠 AI Agent Workflow Example

1. `POST /deploy/token` → get 402 with address  
2. Pay SOL to that address  
3. WebSocket: watch `payment_confirmed`  
4. Deployment executes on Pump.fun  
5. Webhook confirms final token info  

---

## 🧱 Deployment

**Docker**
```bash
docker build -t pumpfun-402-agent .
docker run -d -p 3402:3402 --env-file .env pumpfun-402-agent
```

**PM2**
```bash
pm2 start src/index.js --name "pumpfun-402-agent"
```

